sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Vehicle as Vehicle
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Vehicle: updateOperationalStatus(operationalStatus, statusNote)
    Note over Vehicle: Policies: vehicleRead, vehicleWrite, vehicleExecute
    Note over Vehicle: Guards (2)
    Vehicle->>Vehicle: guard[0]: self.registeredAt != null
    Vehicle->>Vehicle: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Vehicle->>Vehicle: compute.previousStatus
    Vehicle->>Vehicle: mutate.operationalStatus
    Vehicle->>Vehicle: mutate.statusNote
    Vehicle->>Vehicle: mutate.statusChangedAt
    Vehicle->>EventBus: emit VehicleOperationalStatusUpdated on vehicle.operational_status_updated
    Vehicle-->>-Client: void